   "exp": "Critical points −5, 2, 7 (7 excluded). Signs: x < −5 → (−)(−)/(−) < 0 ✓; −5 < x < 2 → positive ✗; 2 < x < 7 → negative ✓; x > 7 positive ✗. Solution: x ≤ −5 or 2 ≤ x < 7. Integers: −20 to −5 → 16; 2 to 6 → 5. Total 21. Trap: including x = 7 (division by zero) to get 22.",
