   "type": "tita",
   "text": "The average of five numbers is 30. If the largest number is removed, the average of the rest falls by 6; if instead the smallest number is removed, the average of the rest rises by 3. What is the average of the middle three numbers?",
   "ans": "26",
   "exp": "Sum = 150. Without the largest: 4 × 24 = 96 → largest = 54. Without the smallest: 4 × 33 = 132 → smallest = 18. Middle three sum = 150 − 54 − 18 = 78 → average 26. Trap: dividing the remaining sum by 4 or 5 instead of 3.",
