   "exp": "Residues mod 3: remainder 0 → 6 numbers (3, …, 18), remainder 1 → 7 (1, …, 19), remainder 2 → 7 (2, …, 20). Sum ≡ 0 when all three share a residue or all three residues differ: C(6,3) + C(7,3) + C(7,3) + 6 × 7 × 7 = 20 + 35 + 35 + 294 = 384. Trap: assuming each class has the same size (C(20,3)/3 ≈ 380) or missing the 'one of each' case.",
